      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "-this- ive only just realized this problem now after trying to favorite my main avatar but this being a problem is honestly ridiculous. i should be able to favorite any of my creations... i have over 600+ creations and since ive uploaded alot since i made my main avatar it takes way too long to scroll all the way back.",
