  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-12-21T05:32:24.286Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "With the new system coming out for the \"Clone Public Avatar\", if you do not want your avatar used you can private it. This removes the ability to favorite your own avatar because it is private. A simple solution would be to enable favoriting for uploaded avatars regardless private or public. A reason this needs to be added is because some people who upload a lot of avatars would like to access the back of their list instantly and cannot when the new system is implemented.",
